                "source": "Twitter Web App",
                "text": "Rather than tackling the rising costs of healthcare, housing, and insurance, this administration has spent its time erasing Black history and stroking the President's ego. \n\nWe need leaders in Congress who are willing to stand up to this racist agenda. \n\nWhen I'm in office, I'll ensure that we honor the history of ALL Americans. #CoriForUs",
