                "source": "Twitter Web App",
                "text": "Everybody deserves housing, a safe community, and to live in dignity.\n\nEverybody deserves access to healthcare, education &  healthy food.\n\nEverybody deserves reproductive freedom & the ability to live free from violence.\n\nThese are human rights.",
