                "quoted_status_profile_username": null,
                "reply_count": 0,
                "retweet_count": 37,
                "source": "Twitter for iPhone",
                "text": "Yesterday, 47 Republican Senators voted against protecting healthcare next year.\u00a0\n\nAs a result, millions of people may lose or drop their health insurance. More of us are going to put off going to the doctor, skip medications, or face the terrible choice between getting life-saving care or financial ruin.\u00a0\n\nI know what that feels like and I refuse to accept that this is our new normal. I\u2019m running to make sure everyone can access\u00a0the healthcare they need.",
